{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y对人物动机和最终选择的叙述有所压缩，尤其弱化了即使以后始终没有人回来，他也愿意独自好好生活这一重要落点。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮关键词建立了清楚的视觉锚点，感受又随音乐进程出现，普通观众更容易在听音乐时抓住情绪转折，而且对声音、节奏、身体反应的描写更细腻具体。X的优势是人物心理因果交代得更充分，前后叙事也更完整，特别是最后从接受孤独到决定不再委屈自己的收束，Y没有完全保留下来。总体而言，Y的视听同步和即时可读性带来的收益更大，但并非所有叙事信息都比X完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "569c5442-309b-42cd-aa89-eba3afb39882", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T223829644239Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:39:22.226440+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c865b31cbc94b0e9d6ed817b4da6fb3a3bae641826f7802d8600c6cf547eeae9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at